      "content": "okay i hear you but im just so anxious about this. i feel like i'm going to pass out if i don't do something. if i dont take the propranolol, what else can i do right now to stop the tremors? is there something like an over the counter thing or a supplement i can take that works similarly but is safer for my lungs? like maybe something with magnesium or something to just take the edge off so i can get through friday?",
